cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SCPTM in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "SCPTM: Structural Contextual Probabilistic Topic Model"
abstract: >-
  Structure-aware topic modelling for the computational social sciences. SCPTM
  combines contextual embeddings, dependency-parsed syntactic edges and a
  variational graph encoder; the companion package scptm-bow provides the
  count-based, deterministic counterpart.
authors:
